/Title (The Campus Sustainability Council \(CSC\), TKMCE Kollam, is an  cross-disciplinary body comprising faculty, students, and industry experts, established to drive sustainability transformation across the campus. It focuses on integrating sustainability into learning, practices, and campus systems through student engagement, green campus initiatives, sustainability audits, experiential learning, innovation, research, and industry collaboration. Ultimately, CSC aims to nurture responsible citizens who think, practise, innovate, and carry sustainability forward)
