/Title (Naamearth seeks to empower the next generation of architects, engineers, educators, researchers, and practitioners with the knowledge, skills, and experience needed to transform the way we design and build. Through experiential learning, research, workshops, and collaborative projects, it creates opportunities to move beyond conventional practices and engage directly with sustainable building technologies and materials.)
